WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:03.567
-The FBI seized the phones
of two Trump aides

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:06.133
and issued 40 subpoenas,
as the Justice Department

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:08.834
intensifies its various
investigations of Donald Trump

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:11.767
and allies, including
MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:14.033
whose phone was also seized
by the FBI.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:16.300
For more on this,
it's time for a closer look.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:23.734
It's genuinely becoming very
difficult for me to keep track

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:26.434
of all the investigations into
Donald Trump and his allies.

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:29.033
For example, one of his closest
associates, Steve Bannon,

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:32.300
was just indicted for, I don't
know, like the 18th time.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.434
The only was I'm able to keep
track is that he wears

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:37.601
a new layer of clothing for
every time he's been arrested.

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:39.968
It's like how you can tell
how old a tree is

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:41.634
by the number of rings it has.

00:00:41.634 --> 00:00:43.434
By the time he actually ends up
going to prison,

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:44.467
he's gonna look like this.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.901
And then we found out Trump's
fundraising activities

00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:51.667
were also under investigation
for potential fraud.

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:54.067
-Blockbuster reporting from
"The New York Times"

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:56.701
that the Justice Department's
January 6th investigation

00:00:56.701 --> 00:00:58.234
is expanding.

00:00:58.234 --> 00:01:01.334
Quote, "A federal grand jury has
issued subpoenas seeking

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:03.701
information about
Save America PAC,

00:01:03.701 --> 00:01:05.634
which was formed
as former President Trump

00:01:05.634 --> 00:01:08.834
promoted baseless assertions
about election fraud."

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:11.367
As a reminder, Trump created
the Save America PAC

00:01:11.367 --> 00:01:13.734
after he lost the 2020 election.

00:01:13.734 --> 00:01:16.434
He raised millions of dollars
by falsely claiming

00:01:16.434 --> 00:01:20.033
that there was rampant voter
fraud that had to be stopped.

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:21.934
And according to
the January 6th Committee,

00:01:21.934 --> 00:01:23.901
Trump and his surrogates
mislead donors

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:27.100
about what their PAC donations
would ultimately be used for.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.534
-You mean to tell me
Donald Trump

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:30.968
has amassed a giant pile of
money that might not entirely

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:32.434
be above board?

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:34.767
[ Laughter ]
Next you're gonna tell me

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:39.434
Chris Pine wasn't thrilled to be
at the Venice Film Festival.

00:01:39.434 --> 00:01:41.701
And in particular, what seems to
have attracted the attention

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:44.200
of the feds, in Trump's case, is
that he seems, and I know

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.901
this will come as a shock, to
have lied to his supporters

00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:47.968
to get their money.

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:18.067
Although, let me stress, I think
most people who donate money

00:02:18.067 --> 00:02:21.634
to Trump would do it no matter
what he said it was for.

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:24.100
I don't know why he opened
himself up to criminal liability

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.868
by lying and saying it was
for a legal fund

00:02:25.868 --> 00:02:27.400
when he could've
just raised as much

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:28.667
from telling his supporters...

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:33.100
Or...

00:02:36.267 --> 00:02:37.534
[ Applause ]

00:02:37.534 --> 00:02:40.701
So those are just a few
of the newest revelations

00:02:40.701 --> 00:02:42.067
we've learned about recently.

00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:45.167
And as I said earlier,
it's getting hard to keep track

00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:47.734
of all of Trump's criminal
investigations.

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:50.200
I mean, I don't even think
I could list them all here

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.934
if I tried, which is a shame
because people should know

00:02:52.934 --> 00:02:55.267
about all of them, given that
the Republican Party

00:02:55.267 --> 00:02:57.133
and so many of its midterm
candidates are standing

00:02:57.133 --> 00:02:58.467
firmly behind Trump.

00:02:58.467 --> 00:03:01.133
I just wish someone would put
all the Trump scandals

00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:03.667
into -- I don't know, one giant
list so we could get a sense

00:03:03.667 --> 00:03:04.968
of Trump's corruption.

00:03:04.968 --> 00:03:07.334
I mean, maybe some young hotshot
journalist dead set on

00:03:07.334 --> 00:03:08.934
taking down the former president

00:03:08.934 --> 00:03:10.300
and the whole Conservative
establishment.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.300
Maybe someone like this man.

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:13.634
-First, it was the Russia hoax,

00:03:13.634 --> 00:03:15.968
then it was Comey's
Crossfire Hurricane,

00:03:15.968 --> 00:03:17.434
Mueller's witch hunt,

00:03:17.434 --> 00:03:20.100
the Emoluments Clause
investigation

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.834
from the House Oversight
Committee,

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:23.767
a House Ways and Means
investigation

00:03:23.767 --> 00:03:25.467
into Trump's taxes,

00:03:25.467 --> 00:03:28.901
another House investigation into
Trump's hotel lease,

00:03:28.901 --> 00:03:32.234
another House investigation into
foreign gift disclosures,

00:03:32.234 --> 00:03:35.434
a D.C. probe into Trump's
inauguration fundraising,

00:03:35.434 --> 00:03:37.901
another similar investigation
from the Southern District

00:03:37.901 --> 00:03:38.901
of New York,

00:03:38.901 --> 00:03:40.567
and the Eastern District
of New York,

00:03:40.567 --> 00:03:42.934
and from New Jersey's
attorney general,

00:03:42.934 --> 00:03:45.968
one impeachment investigation
into a regular phone call

00:03:45.968 --> 00:03:47.300
with Ukraine,

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:50.033
a second impeachment
investigation into January 6th,

00:03:50.033 --> 00:03:53.934
yet another House Committee
investigation into January 6th

00:03:53.934 --> 00:03:56.968
that is still ongoing with more
hearings to come.

00:03:56.968 --> 00:03:59.167
And then there's the Southern
District of New York's

00:03:59.167 --> 00:04:03.734
investigation into pardons,
a DOJ probe into Trump's

00:04:03.734 --> 00:04:05.100
political action committee,

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:08.300
another House investigation into
the Trump Administration's

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.534
security clearance process,

00:04:10.534 --> 00:04:13.534
other investigations into
Trump's property valuations,

00:04:13.534 --> 00:04:16.434
and of course his social media,
Truth Social,

00:04:16.434 --> 00:04:19.100
the Trump Foundation, as well
as a variety of other

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:20.667
tax investigations,

00:04:20.667 --> 00:04:23.133
and of course the
National Archives investigation

00:04:23.133 --> 00:04:24.934
that lead to the Mar-a-Lago
raid.

00:04:24.934 --> 00:04:26.100
You got all that?

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.067
-Mar-a-Lago raid.

00:04:28.067 --> 00:04:30.100
I do now!

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.701
I got it all now.

00:04:31.701 --> 00:04:33.000
[ Applause ]

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.734
[ Laughs ]

00:04:35.734 --> 00:04:38.067
Also those weren't his hats.

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:43.100
Seriously, was that list
supposed to make anyone

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:44.601
other than Donald Trump
look bad?

00:04:44.601 --> 00:04:47.567
It's like a reverse résumé where
you list all the reasons

00:04:47.567 --> 00:04:49.667
you've been fired
from previous jobs.

00:04:49.667 --> 00:04:51.734
Uh, special skills?
Let's see.

00:04:51.734 --> 00:04:54.000
I'm often late,
I steal office supplies,

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.067
I ask co-workers on dates,
and won't take no for an answer,

00:04:57.067 --> 00:04:59.634
I treat every day
like casual Friday

00:04:59.634 --> 00:05:01.901
and every Friday
like underpants Sunday.

00:05:01.901 --> 00:05:04.934
And when I'm given feedback
on my work,

00:05:04.934 --> 00:05:06.334
I have been known
to pull a knife.

00:05:06.334 --> 00:05:09.767
And now I've a question
for you -- when do I start?

00:05:09.767 --> 00:05:11.000
[ Laughter ]

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.767
Don't make me pull my knife!

00:05:13.767 --> 00:05:16.868
He has somehow, as of today --
there is still yet more

00:05:16.868 --> 00:05:19.701
to add to that list, because in
addition to the House hearings

00:05:19.701 --> 00:05:21.501
into January 6th,
there are multiple

00:05:21.501 --> 00:05:24.067
criminal investigations,
including multiple federal

00:05:24.067 --> 00:05:25.367
grand juries that we know of.

00:05:25.367 --> 00:05:27.567
And now, one of those
investigations taking yet

00:05:27.567 --> 00:05:30.434
another extraordinary step
by seizing the phones

00:05:30.434 --> 00:05:33.534
of two Trump aides and issuing
a flurry of subpoenas.

00:05:33.534 --> 00:05:35.267
-"The Times" reports,

00:05:35.267 --> 00:05:36.534
"Justice Department
officials..."

00:06:17.934 --> 00:06:19.400
-40 subpoenas!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.067
Next time Hannity does his list
of Trump investigations,

00:06:22.067 --> 00:06:23.767
he's not even gonna be able
to get to all of them,

00:06:23.767 --> 00:06:25.801
he's just gonna have to read
every fourth entry

00:06:25.801 --> 00:06:27.200
as it scrolls by and call it

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:30.234
"Now That's What I Call A Trump
Criminal Investigation"

00:06:30.234 --> 00:06:34.534
or "Jerk Jams".

00:06:34.534 --> 00:06:37.968
Feel like one of those.

00:06:37.968 --> 00:06:40.200
And by the way, those are just
the investigations

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.434
and subpoenas that are directly
related to Trump's

00:06:42.434 --> 00:06:44.534
personal actions
to overturn the election.

00:06:44.534 --> 00:06:47.501
Then there are the satellite
figures floating in his orbit

00:06:47.501 --> 00:06:49.801
who tried to help out
in their own ways

00:06:49.801 --> 00:06:52.133
and now face
their own legal trouble,

00:06:52.133 --> 00:06:54.234
like MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell.

00:06:54.234 --> 00:06:56.601
And again, I always feel like
I need to clear this up.

00:06:56.601 --> 00:06:58.701
The name of his company is
MyPillow,

00:06:58.701 --> 00:07:01.667
he's not my pillow CEO.

00:07:01.667 --> 00:07:04.133
My pillow CEO is a guy named
David Rosenbaum,

00:07:04.133 --> 00:07:07.400
who does a fantastic job.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:11.334
Started with 15 pillows, I think
we're up to like 19, 20.

00:07:11.334 --> 00:07:13.801
And before we get to the Lindell
news, I also think it's worth

00:07:13.801 --> 00:07:16.501
pausing to reflect on the fact
that one of the president's

00:07:16.501 --> 00:07:18.501
closest outside aides
and advisers

00:07:18.501 --> 00:07:20.601
was a guy who sells [Bleep]
pillows.

00:07:20.601 --> 00:07:22.901
That in itself is not
a good sign.

00:07:22.901 --> 00:07:25.367
President Obama literally had
a Nobel laureate

00:07:25.367 --> 00:07:26.534
in his cabinet.

00:07:26.534 --> 00:07:28.133
I don't remember Obama ever
taking the mic

00:07:28.133 --> 00:07:29.634
at a press conference
and saying,

00:07:29.634 --> 00:07:33.067
"And now, I'd like to introduce
the man who'll be spearheading

00:07:33.067 --> 00:07:35.834
our national infrastructure
plan,

00:07:35.834 --> 00:07:37.567
the ShamWoW guy."

00:07:37.567 --> 00:07:41.300
[ Laughter ]

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:45.434
Now Lindell, of course, already
posted about this story online,

00:07:45.434 --> 00:07:46.901
as you might expect.

00:07:46.901 --> 00:07:50.501
And just as entertaining as
the news itself is the location

00:07:50.501 --> 00:07:52.000
where it happened.

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.200
-Today, the FBI -- you're gonna
hear this, and you're probably

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.868
already hearing it in the news.

00:07:56.868 --> 00:08:01.701
The FBI came after me and took
my phone, they surrounded me

00:08:01.701 --> 00:08:04.167
at a Hardee's,
and took my phone

00:08:04.167 --> 00:08:07.567
that I run all my business,
everything with.

00:08:07.567 --> 00:08:10.334
They could've just -- what
they've done is weaponized

00:08:10.334 --> 00:08:12.501
the FBI.

00:08:12.501 --> 00:08:13.834
It's disgusting.

00:08:13.834 --> 00:08:15.133
I don't have a computer.

00:08:15.133 --> 00:08:17.634
Everything I do -- that phone,
everything was on there.

00:08:17.634 --> 00:08:22.667
And they told me not
to tell anybody.

00:08:22.667 --> 00:08:24.400
Here's an order not to -- don't
tell anybody.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.634
Okay, I won't. [ Chuckles ]

00:08:26.634 --> 00:08:27.767
But I am.

00:08:27.767 --> 00:08:29.934
So, there you go.

00:08:29.934 --> 00:08:32.801
-It's so fitting that they stop
Lindell at a Hardee's,

00:08:32.801 --> 00:08:35.467
because when you think of it,
Hardee's would be

00:08:35.467 --> 00:08:37.667
a more accurate name
for MyPillow.

00:08:37.667 --> 00:08:41.267
[ Laughter ]

00:08:41.267 --> 00:08:44.501
And to be clear, Lindell says it
was at the drive-thru

00:08:44.501 --> 00:08:46.501
at a Hardee's near
Mankato, Minnesota.

00:08:46.501 --> 00:08:47.901
It's just so perfect.

00:08:47.901 --> 00:08:49.767
I think if someone told you,
"Hey, they seized Mike Lindell's

00:08:49.767 --> 00:08:52.200
cellphone," your brain would
just auto-complete the sentence

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.734
with, "At a Mankato Hardee's."

00:08:54.734 --> 00:08:56.534
It's also great because
Lindell's regular

00:08:56.534 --> 00:08:58.701
speaking volume is
everybody else's

00:08:58.701 --> 00:09:00.534
ordering at
a drive-thru volume.

00:09:00.534 --> 00:09:02.033
[ Imitating Lindell ]
"They surrounded me

00:09:02.033 --> 00:09:04.300
at a Hardee's,
and at first I thought

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:07.667
they were gonna take my order,
so I said, 'Okay, I'll have

00:09:07.667 --> 00:09:09.834
97 orders of biscuits.'

00:09:09.834 --> 00:09:12.734
But then they told me they were
with the FBI,

00:09:12.734 --> 00:09:15.901
and I said, 'Does that stand for
Federal Biscuit Inspectors?'

00:09:15.901 --> 00:09:17.767
And they said, 'That's not
a thing.'

00:09:17.767 --> 00:09:20.701
And I said, 'Well, it should be
because sometimes the biscuits

00:09:20.701 --> 00:09:21.734
are too dry.'

00:09:21.734 --> 00:09:23.033
And they said, 'Don't tell
anybody.'

00:09:23.033 --> 00:09:24.100
And I showed them that.

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.300
And that's not the one.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.801
Where'd the thing go?
I don't have a computer."

00:09:28.534 --> 00:09:29.567
[ Normal voice ] I also --

00:09:29.567 --> 00:09:34.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:34.033 --> 00:09:37.767
I also love to imagine Lindell
only eats at restaurants

00:09:37.767 --> 00:09:39.634
and towns that are fun to say
in his voice.

00:09:39.634 --> 00:09:41.033
[ Imitating Lindell ] Where you
guys want to go eat?

00:09:41.033 --> 00:09:44.067
We could go to the Hardee's in
Mankato, or the Arby's

00:09:44.067 --> 00:09:47.200
in Owatonna, or maybe
the Jack in the Box

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:50.634
in Oconomowoc.

00:09:50.634 --> 00:09:52.033
[ Normal voice ] So that's
Lindell's side of the story.

00:09:52.033 --> 00:09:53.734
Although, if you want to hear
more of it,

00:09:53.734 --> 00:09:56.701
you'll apparently have to into
a network other than Fox News,

00:09:56.701 --> 00:09:59.367
because when they reported
on this story last night,

00:09:59.367 --> 00:10:01.901
they briefly played a clip
of Lindell explaining

00:10:01.901 --> 00:10:04.100
the situation just before
cutting him off.

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:07.767
-FBI agents located him,
questioned him,

00:10:07.767 --> 00:10:10.434
showed him their badges,
and asked him questions

00:10:10.434 --> 00:10:13.501
about Colorado and Dominion
voting machines,

00:10:13.501 --> 00:10:15.701
and then provided him
with a warrant

00:10:15.701 --> 00:10:17.834
to seize his cellphone.

00:10:17.834 --> 00:10:20.000
-And then he says, "We're FBI."

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.167
I said, "Show my your badges."

00:10:22.167 --> 00:10:24.400
So they show one badge, I said,
"How about yours?"

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:26.868
You know, 'cause I don't trust
anybody, like, you know,

00:10:26.868 --> 00:10:28.200
there's bad people.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:30.467
Well, they do that, and I say,
"Well, what do you want?"

00:10:30.467 --> 00:10:33.033
And they said, "We need to talk
to you."

00:10:33.033 --> 00:10:36.634
So I pull over, and --

00:10:36.634 --> 00:10:39.367
-Mike Lindell said that he
initially told those agents

00:10:39.367 --> 00:10:41.934
he would not surrender his
phone, because he does not

00:10:41.934 --> 00:10:44.133
have a computer and runs all
of his businesses

00:10:44.133 --> 00:10:45.567
off of that phone.

00:10:45.567 --> 00:10:50.067
-[ Imitating Lindell ]
Where's my camera? Over here?

00:10:50.067 --> 00:10:55.267
Okay, ready to go with my story
about the FBI.

00:10:55.267 --> 00:10:57.934
We're filming this in my office,
so I think I know

00:10:57.934 --> 00:10:59.701
where the camera is.

00:11:03.267 --> 00:11:05.801
[ Normal voice ] They just cut
him off the way you hang up

00:11:05.801 --> 00:11:08.400
on your grandpa over FaceTime.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.501
Hi!

00:11:09.501 --> 00:11:10.701
Hi, grandpa.

00:11:10.701 --> 00:11:12.834
I heard you met a friend today,
what did he say?

00:11:12.834 --> 00:11:14.534
-He says, "We're FBI."

00:11:14.534 --> 00:11:16.834
I said, "Show me your badges."

00:11:16.834 --> 00:11:19.100
So they show one badge, I said,
"How about yours?"

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:21.601
You know, 'cause I don't trust
anybody, you know, like,

00:11:21.601 --> 00:11:22.901
there's bad people.

00:11:22.901 --> 00:11:24.968
Well, they do that, and I say,
"What do you want?"

00:11:24.968 --> 00:11:27.767
And they say,
"We need to talk to you."

00:11:27.767 --> 00:11:29.234
So I pull over --

00:11:29.234 --> 00:11:30.434
-Okay, grandpa, gotta go.

00:11:30.434 --> 00:11:32.100
The FBI is seizing my phone.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:34.100
Bye.

00:11:35.501 --> 00:11:38.534
Although, my favorite part
of the Fox News coverage

00:11:38.534 --> 00:11:41.467
came earlier when Fox host
Tucker Carlson introduced

00:11:41.467 --> 00:11:44.400
the news in a very solemn tone,
but also, for some reason,

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:46.834
threw in a dig at Lindell.

00:11:46.834 --> 00:11:50.067
-This is a Fox News alert
and a shocking one.

00:11:50.067 --> 00:11:53.200
We told you last night that
the Biden Administration

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:56.734
has politicized law enforcement
to the point

00:11:56.734 --> 00:11:58.067
where it feels Soviet.

00:11:58.067 --> 00:11:59.434
And we were not overstating it.

00:11:59.434 --> 00:12:02.734
The FBI has just raided the guy
who sells pillows

00:12:02.734 --> 00:12:05.734
on this channel, not because
the pillows were bad,

00:12:05.734 --> 00:12:07.467
but because they don't like
who he voted for.

00:12:07.467 --> 00:12:10.767
